      "solution": "4^{x-1}=(2^2)^{x-1}=2^{2x-2}. 8^{2x+1}=(2^3)^{2x+1}=2^{6x+3}. So 2x-2=6x+3 => -2-3=6x-2x => -5=4x => x=-5/4",
