      "answer": "Proof",
      "solution": "Let m=p/q, n=r/s. Then (a^{p/q})^{r/s} = (a^{p/q})^{r/s} = (qth root of a^p)^{r/s} = a^{pr/qs} = a^{(p/q)(r/s)} = a^{mn}",
